WEBVTT

00:04:28.121 --> 00:04:31.320
to figure out the immobility of Lubuto.

00:04:32.613 --> 00:04:35.110
On such a tight timeline,

00:04:35.134 --> 00:04:38.685
we needed to build
a support system around him,

00:04:38.709 --> 00:04:42.347
leveraging the limited resources
available to us.

00:04:43.120 --> 00:04:45.658
This was a clear project before us

00:04:45.682 --> 00:04:48.270
which needed to be carefully executed,

00:04:48.294 --> 00:04:50.896
and we needed a capable, self-driven team,

00:04:51.670 --> 00:04:53.239
an agile team.

00:04:54.382 --> 00:04:57.315
"Agile" is a methodology that we use

00:04:57.339 --> 00:05:00.908
to execute projects
with changing requirements